<title>GERMANY: DBKom sees sales rising to one bln marks in 1997.</title>
<headline>DBKom sees sales rising to one bln marks in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German telecommunications group DBKOM GmbH, which is renaming itself Mannesmann Arcor, said on Thursday it had had sales of 900 million marks in 1996 and expected sales of one billion for 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said that it intended to invest 800 million marks in 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
